<import src="../../templates/privacy.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view class="title">{{title}}</view><view class="sub">{{width}}×{{height}} 颗，共 {{total}} 颗豆子</view><view class="status" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在展开图纸…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status">图纸暂时无法展开。<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{!error && !loading}}"><movable-area wx:if="{{preview}}" class="preview section"><movable-view direction="all" scale scale-min="1" scale-max="8" out-of-bounds><image src="{{preview}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="zoom"/></movable-view></movable-area><view wx:if="{{split}}" class="notice">整张图纸预览超出设备能力，请分图放大查看。<button class="secondary" bindtap="viewTiles">查看分图</button></view><view class="fine">双指放大、拖动查看。点击图纸可打开全屏预览。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="toggle" class="check"><label><checkbox value="labels" checked="{{labels}}" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#F58FA7"/>显示颜色编号</label></checkbox-group><view class="section label">这张图纸需要的颜色</view><view class="count" wx:for="{{counts}}" wx:key="id"><view class="swatch" style="background:{{item.hex}}"/>{{item.id}}<text style="float:right">{{item.count}} 颗</text></view><view class="notice">通用颜色编号，非品牌色号；实际选豆请对照颜色。白色背景也计入用豆数。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{busy?'正在处理…':'保存图纸到相册'}}</button><view class="fine" wx:if="{{source!='generated'}}">当前为真机测试版，图纸可直接保存到相册。</view></view><canvas type="2d" id="export" class="canvas-hidden"/></view>

<template is="privacy" data="{{privacyVisible: privacyVisible}}"/>
